{"task_id": "HumanEval/54", "solution": "def same_chars(s0: str, s1: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Check if two words have the same characters, ignoring counts and case.\n    >>> same_chars('eabcdzzzz', 'dddzzzzzzzddeddabc')\n    True\n    >>> same_chars('abcd', 'dddddddabc')\n    True\n    >>> same_chars('dddddddabc', 'abcd')\n    True\n    >>> same_chars('eabcd', 'dddddddabc')\n    False\n    >>> same_chars('abcd', 'dddddddabce')\n    False\n    >>> same_chars('eabcdzzzz', 'dddzzzzzzzddddabc')\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    set0 = set(s0.casefold())\n    set1 = set(s1.casefold())\n    return set0 == set1"}
