{"task_id": "HumanEval/69", "solution": "def search(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the greatest positive integer x such that its frequency in the list is greater than or equal to x.\n    Returns -1 if no such integer exists.\n    \"\"\"\n    frequencies = {}\n    for x in lst:\n        frequencies[x] = frequencies.get(x, 0) + 1\n\n    candidates = []\n    for value, count in frequencies.items():\n        if value > 0 and count >= value:\n            candidates.append(value)\n\n    if not candidates:\n        return -1\n    return max(candidates)"}
