{"task_id": "HumanEval/84", "solution": "```python\ndef solve(N):\n    \"\"\"Given an integer N, return the total sum of its decimal digits in binary.\n\n    N is assumed to be within 0 <= N <= 10000.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Calculate the sum of decimal digits.\n    digit_sum = 0\n    for digit_char in str(N):\n        digit_sum += int(digit_char)\n\n    # Convert the sum to a binary string, stripping the \"0b\" prefix.\n    binary_string = bin(digit_sum)[2:]\n    return binary_string\n```"}
