{"task_id": "HumanEval/111", "solution": "```python\nimport collections\n\ndef histogram(test):\n    \"\"\"Given a string of space-separated lowercase letters, returns a dictionary\n    of letter(s) with the highest occurrence and their counts.\n    If input is empty or results in no valid tokens, an empty dictionary is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    tokens = test.split()\n\n    if not tokens:\n        return {}\n\n    counts = collections.Counter(tokens)\n\n    # Find the maximum count among all letters.\n    # This assumes `counts` is not empty, which is guaranteed if `tokens` was not empty.\n    max_count = max(counts.values())\n\n    # Filter to include only letters that have the maximum occurrence.\n    result = {letter: count for letter, count in counts.items() if count == max_count}\n    return result\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/110", "solution": "def exchange(lst1, lst2):\n    \"\"\"Determines if elements can be exchanged between two lists to make lst1 all even.\n    Returns \"YES\" if possible, otherwise \"NO\".\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    a_odd = 0\n    for x in lst1:\n        if x % 2 != 0:\n            a_odd += 1\n\n    if a_odd == 0:\n        return \"YES\"\n\n    b_even = 0\n    for x in lst2:\n        if x % 2 == 0:\n            b_even += 1\n\n    if b_even >= a_odd:\n        return \"YES\"\n    else:\n        return \"NO\""}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/111", "solution": "def histogram(test):\n    \"\"\"Given a string representing a space separated lowercase letters, return a dictionary\n    of the letter with the most repetition and containing the corresponding count.\n    If several letters have the same occurrence, return all of them.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not test:\n        return {}\n\n    tokens = [t for t in test.split() if t]\n    \n    if not tokens:\n        return {}\n\n    counts = {}\n    for token in tokens:\n        counts[token] = counts.get(token, 0) + 1\n\n    max_count = 0\n    if counts:\n        max_count = max(counts.values())\n\n    result = {letter: count for letter, count in counts.items() if count == max_count}\n    return result"}
